# budget is ample / the 125% figure is mechanical (mr-cost-watch:555/561 gate BOTH on
# `[ "$ENFORCE" = 1 ]`, and mr-budget-config.json ships costwatch_enforce=false — MONITOR
# mode only; live proof: COSTWATCH ... HARD-MONITOR 125% ... enforce=false or log-stalled,
# run continued to 183% of cap), while the distinct-lenses-over-redundant-re-runs instruction
# it was replaced with must survive (E1/E2/E3, monster-realm-lp-brief-cost-plan.md). A1 is a
