# lp-queue / lp-handoff-rotate — behavioural fixtures against the REAL mr-record, same isolation
# discipline as the lp-02 block above: MR_RECORD_STATE and MR_RECORD_HANDOFF are redirected into a
# tempdir and this block REFUSES to run if either would resolve under $MEM, so no fixture can ever
