#
# Regression coverage for the two design-review findings that would otherwise ship silently broken:
# (1) mid-tick queue-add/-remove must be independently durable (not clobbered by a later free-hand
# mr-state.json write) -- proven here by two SEPARATE queue-add calls both surviving, since a
# stale-snapshot bug would show as the second call's write appearing to lose the first's; (2) an
# entry-boundary regex requiring an em-dash silently glued 11/197 real entries onto their neighbour
# during design red-team -- proven here with a non-em-dash header mixed into the fixture.
